  titleAccent: 'a guided tour',
  hook: 'The first word of the poem is rage. The Iliad spans about fifty days near the end of the Trojan War, and it is a poem about what one man\'s anger costs everyone — including himself.',
  themesBlurb: 'Rage, honor, fate, mortality, the gods on the field of battle.',
